# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Market Split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "ปัญหา Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"ตาราง 1 แสดงตัวชี้วัดประสิทธิภาพเฉพาะสำหรับ Parity Twine Optimizer ที่นำไปใช้กับอินสแตนซ์ต่าง ๆ ของปัญหา Market Split (MS)\n"
"สิ่งเหล่านี้ได้มาจาก [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) และสอดคล้องกับ\n"
"[การส่ง](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) ที่ทำขึ้นสำหรับ\n"
"ไลบรารีโดยใช้ Parity Twine Optimizer\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
